{
  "category": "Fire Horse Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "Its hooves are 10 times harder than diamonds. It can trample anything completely flat in little time.",
      "version": "red"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its hooves are 10 times harder than diamonds. It can trample anything completely flat in little time.",
      "version": "blue"
    },
    {
      "text": "Capable of jumping incredibly high. Its hooves and sturdy legs absorb the impact of a hard landing.",
      "version": "yellow"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is a weak runner immediately after birth. It gradually becomes faster by chasing after its parents.",
      "version": "gold"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its hind legs, which have harder-than-diamond hooves, kick back at any presence it senses behind it.",
      "version": "silver"
    },
    {
      "text": "Training by jumping over grass that grows longer every day has made it a world-class jumper.",
      "version": "crystal"
    },
    {
      "text": "PONYTA is very weak at birth. It can barely stand up. This POKéMON becomes stronger by stumbling and falling to keep up with its parent.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "PONYTA is very weak at birth. It can barely stand up. This POKéMON becomes stronger by stumbling and falling to keep up with its parent.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "A PONYTA is very weak at birth. It can barely stand up. Its legs become stronger as it stumbles and falls while trying to keep up with its parent.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its body is light, and its legs are incredibly powerful. It can clear Ayers Rock in one leap.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its hooves are ten times harder than diamond. It can trample anything completely flat in little time.",
      "version": "leafgreen"
    },
    {
      "text": "About an hour after birth, its fiery mane and tail grow out, giving it an impressive appearance.",
      "version": "diamond"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its legs grow strong while it chases after its parent. It runs in fields and mountains all day.",
      "version": "pearl"
    },
    {
      "text": "As a newborn, it can barely stand. However, through galloping, its legs are made tougher and faster.",
      "version": "platinum"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is a weak runner immediately after birth. It gradually becomes faster by chasing after its parents.",
      "version": "heartgold"
    },
    {
